"                    product categories to create an intuitive, fast-paced "
"checkout screen for your\n"
"                    bar staff."
msgstr ""

#. module: sports_club
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:sports_club.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<strong>Subscription-Driven Tiers:</strong> Define your membership packages "
"as\n"
